Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug was an incorrect pin assignment for the wl127x interrupt, which led to conflicts with the SMC911x ethernet driver. The original configuration mistakenly used the wrong GPIO pins for the wl127x device, preventing it from functioning correctly and causing potential issues with other devices sharing the same GPIO resources.

